OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist killed on M56 after
OL,4,Apolice pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcycle rider being pursued by
OL,7,Fpolice on a motorway has been killed
OL,8,Fafter he fled his bike and was hit by
OL,9,Fanother vehicle.
OL,11,FOfficers spotted a red motorcycle being
OL,12,Fdriven in a dangerous manner on the M60
OL,13,Fclockwise around Stockport Pyramid
OL,14,Fshortly before 19:30 BST on Saturday,
OL,15,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said.
OL,17,FThe force said it was brought to a stop
OL,18,Fon the M56 but the man ran off across
OL,19,Fthe motorway and was hit and killed by
OL,20,Fanother vehicle.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
