OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist killed on M56 after
OL,4,Apolice pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FGMP said, in line with procedures
OL,7,Ffollowing a fatality after police
OL,8,Fcontact, it has referred the matter to
OL,9,Fthe Independent Office for Police
OL,10,FConduct (IOPC).
